{"id":"c6aba3343ae870e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Properness Witness","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing12 Properness Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing12 Properness Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing12 Properness Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fee1253e7ff15977\" href=\"?note=fee1253e7ff15977\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,p,q,M,\\theta\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,p,q,M,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\\)</span> (countable-model genericity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fee1253e7ff15977\" href=\"?note=fee1253e7ff15977\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}properness\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\\cap M\n\\land q\\in P\n\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,P,\\leq_P,q,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}properness\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\\cap M\n\\land q\\in P\n\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,P,\\leq_P,q,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A properness witness is precisely an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,P)\">\\((M,P)\\)</span>-generic condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> extending the prescribed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in M\\cap P\">\\(p\\in M\\cap P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The full predensity requirement is inherited from the generic-condition predicate rather than duplicated with divergent argument conventions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"fee1253e7ff15977","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"fee1253e7ff15977","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S$ (countable-model genericity predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing3-countable-model-generic-condition.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,p,q,M,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}properness\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\\cap M\n\\land q\\in P\n\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3CountableModelGenericCondition}_S\n(M,P,\\leq_P,q,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(M,P)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in M\\cap P","display":false}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"12fe2c789b4c78f9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2052","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","fee1253e7ff15977"]}